## Shopping here as an agent

- Store: {{ agents.store_url }}
- UCP discovery: {{ agents.ucp_discovery_url }} (UCP versions: {{ agents.ucp_versions }})
- MCP endpoint: {{ agents.mcp_endpoint_url }}
- Sitemap: {{ agents.sitemap_url }}
- Read-only browsing: product pages at {{ agents.store_url }}/products/{handle} and all products at {{ agents.store_url }}/collections/all.
- Personal shopping agents can use the Shop skill for this store.
- Identify agent-initiated requests as agent traffic; server-to-server requests and hosted browsers use Web Bot Auth.
- In a browser, use the store's WebMCP tools for shopping actions rather than scripting page controls.
- Back off when the store answers 429.

## What not to assume

- This store does not state that its wooden utensils are dishwasher safe.
- Prices and availability change; read them from the shopping tools or the product page at the time of the request, not from this file.
- This file carries no contact email or phone number. Write to help@mail.example or call +1 (555) 010-2030, or use the contact page: {{ agents.store_url }}/pages/contact
